    812  f3c4							; jmp operand is fetched from THIS bank). GRP0 frame pick: jet flutter
    813  f3c4							; (PlayerSpriteA/B) > ground walk (PlayerWalkA/B, phase EnemyRamP&$08) >
    814  f3c4							; static A. Clobbers A/Y; sets Grp0Ptr/Grp0PtrHi; tail-jmps ReturnPad so the
