    911  f434							; --- strip destroyed by a bomb? (EnemyDeadMask b3 — StripBlastCheck
    912  f434							; set it this overscan) → blank all band gates so the cave renders no
    913  f434							; strip; the pack below then emits mask 0 → every overlay stays
    914  f434							; transparent too. BandTab restages from ROM next room entry. ---
    915  f434		       a5 ba		      lda	EnemyDeadMask
    916  f436		       29 08		      and	#$08
