   1923  fcf0							; $FE80 tramp -> `jmp $FCF0` here). Fold-free: the hot-rect stream (RoomRects)
   1924  fcf0							; is level data in THIS bank, so the 7 `jsr FoldIndirect` become direct
   1925  fcf0							; `lda (FetchPtr),Y` (one less push level on the hot path too).
   1926  fcf0							; Behavior (full docs moved with the body): if the player's proposed tile
   1927  fcf0							; range (CollisionCell*) overlaps any hot-only rect, set Temp bit 7 (HotBump).
   1928  fcf0							; Called from PlayerHitsMap HIT while CollisionCell* still describe the
   1929  fcf0							; rejected position. Hot record = parent mask, x, y, w, h (5 B); parent mask
   1930  fcf0							; & BombPacked != 0 = that wall was blasted -> hot piece dead.
   1931  fcf0							; Contract: TAIL-CALLED from bank0 (`jmp`, 0 push) — every exit must return
   1932  fcf0							; C=1 to the ORIGINAL PlayerHitsMap caller. Exits therefore end
   1933  fcf0							; `sec / jmp $FBF8` (ReturnPad: sta $1FF6 switches to bank0, rts pops the
   1934  fcf0							; pre-tramp return address; sta touches neither A nor flags -> C survives).
   1935  fcf0							; Clobbers A/X/Y/FetchPtr/RectCount (caller returns immediately after).
