   2060  fd87							; Entered from bank0 stub (sta $1FF8 / jmp <here> — operand in kernel.asm,
   2061  fd87							; twin at $FDD8 below), 0 pushes; every exit `jmp $FBF8` ReturnPad.
   2062  fd87							; Out: A = 1 kill (caller awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none (Z set).
   2063  fd87							; Clobbers A/X/Y. Level enemy records live in THIS bank, so the type read
   2064  fd87							; is a direct (EnemyDataLo),Y — no fold.
   2065  fd87							; Lives here (after .HOVdone) — NOT between TitleJetColors and the $F970
   2066  fd87							; pad: test_title_demo diffs that whole source span for $xx color literals.
