   2470  ff59							; VcrShutter — sprite-shutter staging (vcrunch_shutter_plan Phase B).
   2471  ff59							; Tail-entered from PhVcrPre (PhaseBlink walk, 0 pushes — the VBL chain sits
   2472  ff59							; on the measured SP floor) and tail-exits at .PhRec.
   2473  ff59							;   IN:  FetchPtr = hot record stream, Y = record base (class byte)
   2474  ff59							;   OUT: Y = base+4 (.PhRec contract: its iny -> base+5 = next class)
   2475  ff59							;   Clobbers A/X/Y + LineCount/CollisionCellX/CollisionEndY/Temp (all
   2476  ff59							;   PhaseBlink scratch in this window; the pack rebuilds CollisionEndY
   2477  ff59							;   after PhaseBlink returns). NO stack use.
   2478  ff59							; - Punches the vcrunch bbox OPEN in PF0/1/2Buf (pair-range AND): the ball
   2479  ff59							;   block would hide under a solid cell (CTRLPF priority), and the render
   2480  ff59							;   and the cell walk share the buffers by design. Reflect mirrors the
   2481  ff59							;   punched left-half cell to the right half.
   2482  ff59							; - Stages Temp = mirrored BallX = 159-4x (right edge; >= 87 so the pack's
   2483  ff59							;   (Temp-87)>>3 decode stays valid) and BandTab[band..band+h-1] = $ff —
   2484  ff59							;   the D6 ball machinery then renders the block with zero kernel changes.
